  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "土壤力學",
    "sub_ename": "SOIL MECHANICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程引導研習者自大地工程觀點了解土壤的種類及構造、土壤組成、土壤分類方法、土壤的滲透係數及滲流量與滲流作用力、土體中的應力、土壤的壓縮性與沉陷量、及土壤的剪力強度等內容。研習的內容是大地工程相關構造物如建築物基礎、擋土構造物等分析的必備工具。",
    "describe_eh": "This course guides learners to know subject related to soil from point view of geotechnical engineering, such as types and structure of soil, soil composition, methods of soil classification, permeability of soil, seepage and seepage force of water in soils, stresses in soils, compression and settlement of soils, and shear strength of soils.  The contents provide required tools for the design of geotechnical related structures such as foundations of building and retaining structures.",
    "pre_subname": "CE2078材料力學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "CE2078",
    "pre_sub_ename": "CE2078 MECHANICS OF MATERIALS",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "認知土壤力學有關術語的定義",
